// Attempt 1 — first pass at the no-show detection. Kept for the record: this
// version FAILS by design. 'ScheduledTime' does not exist in the BusTelemetry
// schema; the real column is 'ScheduleTime'. See README — KQL Query Evolution.
// Source: BusTelemetry (Eventhouse: DetectiveAgency, live Eventstream)

BusTelemetry
| extend Delay = Timestamp - ScheduledTime
| summarize MaxDelay = max(Delay) by BusLine
| top 5 by MaxDelay desc
